module Core

### Represents the protocol for in-place Euclidean division operators.
### `InPlaceFloorDivisible` groups quotient and remainder mutations for
### integer-like values that support direct update of the left-hand operand.
protocol InPlaceFloorDivisible
  ### Applies floor division by `you` in place.
  ### :param you: The divisor.
  @writable
  routine Me.ifloordiv(you: Me)

  ### Applies modulo by `you` in place.
  ### This replaces the current value with the remainder associated with `you`.
  ### :param you: The divisor.
  @writable
  routine Me.imod(you: Me)
